{"title":"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A house and store were sold for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/d/08de52405c9d271d6ad89b53e20fde486ce76548.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar 12,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"17\" /> each. The house was sold at a loss of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of the cost, and the store at a gain of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of the cost. The entire transaction resulted in:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8139b645f8f746dd12b5e5b4d52d934c0725546d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) \\ }\\text{no loss or gain}  \\qquad \\textbf{(B) \\ }\\text{loss of }\\textdollar 1000 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) \\ }\\text{gain of }\\textdollar 1000 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) \\ }\\text{gain of }\\textdollar 2000 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) \\ }\\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"837\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Denote the original price of the house and the store as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8189a5b5a0917b8c93350827be4038af1839139d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, respectively. It is given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/2/3323704af820ea10e01fceb134a201e39176ddbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4h}{5}=\\textdollar 12,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"109\" height=\"37\" />, and that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/c/7ec8dd220f2e2d4ae49101208bb0f83514bc0b34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6s}{5}=\\textdollar 12,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"107\" height=\"37\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/8/b18849e26d2360ef6eb681f874c951252e372c5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h=\\textdollar 15,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/b/45b53a8021e87aac9af9ca952982d6202f3d885a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s=\\textdollar10,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"94\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/b/0bbbcac2627b8c8317d084c274d6fd26eb697fda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h+s=\\textdollar25,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"127\" height=\"17\" />. This value is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/5/805d460c4bb0ab7827844b0c21ff4c9b8ae17304.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> higher than the current price of the property, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/f/7cfe82bf531d5eac3f832c600dd688db46c5aa43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cdot \\textdollar12,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />. Hence, the transaction resulted in a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/3/e33c6157fe307c0f28cdda4fecc6d6c334ddfa11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{loss of }\\textdollar1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"141\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME\" title=\"1952 AHSME\">1952 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1952 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1952\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\"